OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey is set to unveil
OL,8,Fhis first Budget on Wednesday.
OL,10,FUnlike in previous years there have
OL,11,Fbeen very few leaks about what will be
OL,12,Fin it, though Healey's tax and spending
OL,13,Fplans will be under close scrutiny at a
OL,14,Ftime when government borrowing costs
OL,15,Fare at "historic highs".
OL,17,FBBC News has been speaking to people on
OL,18,Fa range of incomes on how they feel
OL,19,Fabout their finances and what they
OL,20,Fwould like to see in the Budget.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
